WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.208 --> 00:00:31.583
In the previous three verses,

2
00:00:31.583 --> 00:00:33.416
Lord Krishna explained

3
00:00:33.416 --> 00:00:37.208
how people attracted toward material desires

4
00:00:37.208 --> 00:00:39.958
worship other gods and goddesses

5
00:00:39.958 --> 00:00:42.583
and have faith in them.

6
00:00:42.583 --> 00:00:44.416
Lord Krishna also explained

7
00:00:44.416 --> 00:00:45.208
that He makes this faith

8
00:00:45.208 --> 00:00:46.791
toward other deities

9
00:00:46.791 --> 00:00:49.250
firm in humans.

10
00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:50.750
And then in the previous verse

11
00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:52.250
He said that the fruit

12
00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:54.625
obtained from worship of
 other gods and goddesses

13
00:00:54.625 --> 00:00:57.000
is also ultimately possible because of

14
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.083
Lord Krishna's grace.

15
00:01:00.083 --> 00:01:03.000
Now here the question arises –

16
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:05.791
then what's the difference between
 Lord Krishna devotion

17
00:01:05.791 --> 00:01:09.500
and devotion of other gods and goddesses?

18
00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:12.625
And can those who worship
 other gods and goddesses

19
00:01:12.625 --> 00:01:16.041
be liberated from the cycle of birth and death?

20
00:01:16.041 --> 00:01:19.250
These very things are explained in this verse.

21
00:01:23.583 --> 00:01:25.083
Lord Krishna says

22
00:01:25.083 --> 00:01:26.958
that people of little intelligence

23
00:01:26.958 --> 00:01:29.125
obtain their desired fruit through these rituals,

24
00:01:29.125 --> 00:01:30.666
but these fruits

25
00:01:30.666 --> 00:01:34.708
are temporary, not permanent.

26
00:01:34.708 --> 00:01:38.333
And people who worship
 other gods and goddesses

27
00:01:38.333 --> 00:01:40.500
go near them,

28
00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:41.958
but My devotees

29
00:01:41.958 --> 00:01:44.458
ultimately attain Me.

30
00:01:44.458 --> 00:01:46.083
Lord Krishna is explaining here

31
00:01:46.083 --> 00:01:47.791
in very clear words

32
00:01:47.791 --> 00:01:50.458
what's the difference between
 worship of other deities

33
00:01:50.458 --> 00:01:53.791
and direct worship of Lord Krishna.

34
00:01:53.791 --> 00:01:56.750
Where fruits obtained from
 worship of other deities

35
00:01:56.750 --> 00:02:00.500
are material and temporary, there

36
00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:02.458
fruits obtained from worship of Lord Krishna

37
00:02:02.458 --> 00:02:04.208
are permanent

38
00:02:04.208 --> 00:02:07.375
and lead toward spiritual advancement.

39
00:02:07.375 --> 00:02:10.958
But some people still, surrounded by desires,

40
00:02:10.958 --> 00:02:13.625
because of these momentary
 material pleasures

41
00:02:13.625 --> 00:02:16.708
engage in worship of other gods and goddesses.

42
00:02:16.708 --> 00:02:17.958
And naturally,

43
00:02:17.958 --> 00:02:21.000
these material fruits don't last long,

44
00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:23.875
humans get surrounded by sorrows again

45
00:02:23.875 --> 00:02:26.875
and the cycle of happiness-sorrow continues,

46
00:02:26.875 --> 00:02:30.583
where sorrow is more and happiness is less.

47
00:02:30.583 --> 00:02:32.541
There's no wisdom in this –

48
00:02:32.541 --> 00:02:34.041
that before you is the path

49
00:02:34.041 --> 00:02:36.125
of supreme and permanent happiness,

50
00:02:36.125 --> 00:02:36.958
but still

51
00:02:36.958 --> 00:02:38.750
you want to remain trapped in the cycle

52
00:02:38.750 --> 00:02:42.166
of momentary gain and happiness-sorrow.

53
00:02:42.166 --> 00:02:43.708
For this reason, Lord Krishna

54
00:02:43.708 --> 00:02:45.833
is clearly calling such people

55
00:02:45.833 --> 00:02:47.166
'alpa-medhasām,'

56
00:02:47.166 --> 00:02:50.875
meaning of little intelligence.

57
00:02:50.875 --> 00:02:53.583
Understand the meaning of this thing 

58
00:02:53.583 --> 00:02:56.958
Lord Krishna said in previous few
 verses and repeated here,

59
00:02:56.958 --> 00:02:59.541
this is a very important subject.

60
00:02:59.541 --> 00:03:00.625
Lord Krishna

61
00:03:00.625 --> 00:03:04.166
is certainly not declaring worship
 of other deities as wrong,

62
00:03:04.166 --> 00:03:06.916
He's only trying to say

63
00:03:06.916 --> 00:03:08.166
why does a human run after

64
00:03:08.166 --> 00:03:11.708
material and momentary things?

65
00:03:11.708 --> 00:03:15.500
Why doesn't one look toward the
 supreme happiness of liberation?

66
00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:19.625
Understand this with a school example,

67
00:03:19.625 --> 00:03:22.083
where there are all classes, small and big.

68
00:03:22.083 --> 00:03:24.500
In small age, small class is appropriate,

69
00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:25.375
and in big age,

70
00:03:25.375 --> 00:03:27.791
mature education has importance.

71
00:03:27.791 --> 00:03:30.583
But if someone in growing age

72
00:03:30.583 --> 00:03:32.625
wants to remain stuck in small class,

73
00:03:32.625 --> 00:03:34.958
then what wisdom is this?

74
00:03:34.958 --> 00:03:38.416
Here both small and big classes
 are right according to age,

75
00:03:38.416 --> 00:03:42.166
but progressing with time is wisdom.

76
00:03:42.166 --> 00:03:43.875
Similarly, at a time,

77
00:03:43.875 --> 00:03:45.500
for material desires

78
00:03:45.500 --> 00:03:49.125
worship of other gods and
 goddesses is also not wrong.

79
00:03:49.125 --> 00:03:51.750
Just as every type of education is good,

80
00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:55.291
similarly every type of worship is good.

81
00:03:55.291 --> 00:03:56.916
Lord Krishna Himself

82
00:03:56.916 --> 00:03:58.416
keeps this faith

83
00:03:58.416 --> 00:04:00.541
toward other deities stable.

84
00:04:00.541 --> 00:04:02.625
But moving forward with time,

85
00:04:02.625 --> 00:04:04.291
instead of momentary gain

86
00:04:04.291 --> 00:04:08.250
moving toward supreme happiness
 is the appropriate result, right?

87
00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:12.000
And this supreme happiness is possible only

88
00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:13.416
through Lord Krishna devotion.

89
00:04:18.208 --> 00:04:19.500
Someone worships

90
00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:21.958
some other deity,

91
00:04:21.958 --> 00:04:24.875
then they attain them,

92
00:04:24.875 --> 00:04:27.916
and one who worships Me

93
00:04:27.916 --> 00:04:30.958
attains Me.

94
00:04:30.958 --> 00:04:32.875
In personal life too,

95
00:04:32.875 --> 00:04:37.541
on whichever thing you focus your attention,

96
00:04:37.541 --> 00:04:40.500
that's what you'll obtain.

97
00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:43.000
If your mind

98
00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:45.500
is inspired only by temporary success

99
00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:49.041
and material cravings,

100
00:04:49.041 --> 00:04:51.875
then that's what will be obtained.

101
00:04:51.875 --> 00:04:53.416
There,

102
00:04:53.416 --> 00:04:54.291
if you're

103
00:04:54.291 --> 00:04:58.416
walking with a deep life purpose,

104
00:04:58.416 --> 00:05:02.000
where your spiritual progress happens

105
00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:05.416
and permanent satisfaction is obtained,

106
00:05:05.416 --> 00:05:08.000
then paths to obtain that

107
00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:11.083
are also open.

108
00:05:11.083 --> 00:05:16.958
Here, only one thing needs to be kept in mind –

109
00:05:16.958 --> 00:05:20.666
that humans many times say something

110
00:05:20.666 --> 00:05:24.250
and do something else.

111
00:05:24.250 --> 00:05:28.625
Say that permanent satisfaction is wanted,

112
00:05:28.625 --> 00:05:32.416
but the very next moment

113
00:05:32.416 --> 00:05:37.500
start going toward material desires.

114
00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:41.666
So if you changed direction itself,

115
00:05:41.666 --> 00:05:45.583
then destination will also change, right?

116
00:05:45.583 --> 00:05:47.750
So what will you choose?

117
00:05:47.750 --> 00:05:51.625
The path of small material successes,

118
00:05:51.625 --> 00:05:54.958
where there's joy for some moments,

119
00:05:54.958 --> 00:05:56.666
but on that path

120
00:05:56.666 --> 00:05:59.958
there are many pits of sorrow
 and dissatisfaction.

121
00:05:59.958 --> 00:06:02.833
Or will you choose that path

122
00:06:02.833 --> 00:06:06.416
which may seem difficult at the beginning,

123
00:06:06.416 --> 00:06:10.708
but then on that path there's no obstacle,

124
00:06:10.708 --> 00:06:15.916
only progress and deep joy.

125
00:06:15.916 --> 00:06:20.833
When you live life with a deep purpose,

126
00:06:20.833 --> 00:06:25.250
then you don’t run after insignificant things.

127
00:06:25.250 --> 00:06:28.416
You start understanding that permanent

128
00:06:28.416 --> 00:06:32.541
success can be obtained only by

129
00:06:32.541 --> 00:06:37.625
walking on the path of austerity,
 patience, and truth.

130
00:06:37.625 --> 00:06:41.000
Why happiness of only a few moments?

131
00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:42.708
I want you

132
00:06:42.708 --> 00:06:46.625
to remain always joyful.

133
00:06:46.625 --> 00:06:49.333
Therefore, don't get trapped in the attraction

134
00:06:49.333 --> 00:06:53.708
of momentary materialism and success.

135
00:06:53.708 --> 00:06:58.333
Apply your strength and attention
 in the right direction,

136
00:06:58.333 --> 00:06:59.583
and also

137
00:06:59.583 --> 00:07:03.833
remain committed to the spiritual path.

138
00:07:03.833 --> 00:07:07.583
If you remain committed to this path,

139
00:07:07.583 --> 00:07:10.458
then you'll obtain everything –

140
00:07:10.458 --> 00:07:14.083
permanent success too, life's joy too,

141
00:07:14.083 --> 00:07:18.208
and yes,

142
00:07:18.208 --> 00:07:19.916
Me too.

143
00:07:24.458 --> 00:07:28.250
In family environment,
 many times it's been seen

144
00:07:28.250 --> 00:07:32.708
that people become so focused on their

145
00:07:32.708 --> 00:07:37.250
 material comforts, wealth,
 property, and their pride

146
00:07:37.250 --> 00:07:40.041
that they ignore the real purposes

147
00:07:40.041 --> 00:07:43.666
of family life.

148
00:07:43.666 --> 00:07:45.166
Just as

149
00:07:45.166 --> 00:07:48.416
worship of other gods and goddesses

150
00:07:48.416 --> 00:07:50.750
gives temporary fruits

151
00:07:50.750 --> 00:07:54.083
but doesn't give deep satisfaction, similarly,

152
00:07:54.083 --> 00:07:58.166
by worshipping only materialism,

153
00:07:58.166 --> 00:08:02.208
even if wealth-property is obtained,

154
00:08:02.208 --> 00:08:06.083
the joy of family love cannot be obtained.

155
00:08:06.083 --> 00:08:08.583
Many times this situation

156
00:08:08.583 --> 00:08:11.708
becomes so critical

157
00:08:11.708 --> 00:08:14.375
that brother from brother, children

158
00:08:14.375 --> 00:08:17.458
from even deceiving their parents

159
00:08:17.458 --> 00:08:20.750
don't hold back.

160
00:08:20.750 --> 00:08:22.625
Materialism's veil

161
00:08:22.625 --> 00:08:26.125
blinds the mind's eyes.

162
00:08:26.125 --> 00:08:29.000
Understand this thing –

163
00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:34.666
family is a gift for human life.

164
00:08:34.666 --> 00:08:36.125
This family will

165
00:08:36.125 --> 00:08:39.958
stand by you in crisis.

166
00:08:39.958 --> 00:08:43.458
People attracted by your material success

167
00:08:43.458 --> 00:08:47.458
are as temporary as that success.

168
00:08:47.458 --> 00:08:49.125
As soon as success disappears,

169
00:08:49.125 --> 00:08:51.291
those people will also disappear.

170
00:08:51.291 --> 00:08:52.750
But

171
00:08:52.750 --> 00:08:56.458
parents, siblings will remain always –

172
00:08:56.458 --> 00:08:59.916
in happiness also and in sorrow also.

173
00:08:59.916 --> 00:09:01.166
What's needed is

174
00:09:01.166 --> 00:09:05.250
to water these relationships with love.

175
00:09:05.250 --> 00:09:09.083
So never abandon family

176
00:09:09.083 --> 00:09:11.833
behind material success.

177
00:09:11.833 --> 00:09:14.041
Material things are only

178
00:09:14.041 --> 00:09:16.916
a small necessity of life,

179
00:09:16.916 --> 00:09:20.083
not life's main purpose.

180
00:09:20.083 --> 00:09:22.375
Life's main purpose is

181
00:09:22.375 --> 00:09:25.500
to make spiritual progress. And family

182
00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:27.500
members must help each other

183
00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:31.291
in this spiritual progress.

184
00:09:31.291 --> 00:09:33.166
Therefore,

185
00:09:33.166 --> 00:09:36.208
you yourself also walk

186
00:09:36.208 --> 00:09:39.375
on this path of spirituality, and inspire family

187
00:09:39.375 --> 00:09:44.208
members also to walk together.

188
00:09:44.208 --> 00:09:45.750
The family

189
00:09:45.750 --> 00:09:50.125
that leaves materialism and
 leans toward spirituality,

190
00:09:50.125 --> 00:09:52.625
the family that makes

191
00:09:52.625 --> 00:09:55.250
a relationship of devotion with Me,

192
00:09:55.250 --> 00:09:59.125
in that family then forever

193
00:09:59.125 --> 00:10:04.708
only love and joy will flow.

194
00:10:04.708 --> 00:10:09.583
Come, come towards spirituality,

195
00:10:09.583 --> 00:10:11.500
come towards Me,

196
00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:15.833
come with family.

197
00:10:20.583 --> 00:10:22.666
In the business world,

198
00:10:22.666 --> 00:10:25.791
you'll see many people

199
00:10:25.791 --> 00:10:29.041
who with cleverness, politics,

200
00:10:29.041 --> 00:10:34.375
and deceit have greed to
 obtain maximum gain –

201
00:10:34.375 --> 00:10:37.416
whether it's desire for promotion,

202
00:10:37.416 --> 00:10:39.000
or economic greed,

203
00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:42.708
or desire for fame.

204
00:10:42.708 --> 00:10:45.000
Just as worship of deities

205
00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:47.083
gives only that gain

206
00:10:47.083 --> 00:10:51.000
which is material but temporary, similarly

207
00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:54.000
this cleverness, deceit too

208
00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:57.958
can give success for some time,

209
00:10:57.958 --> 00:11:00.125
but ultimately

210
00:11:00.125 --> 00:11:02.875
there will also be bad consequences.

211
00:11:02.875 --> 00:11:07.166
When you obtain success by
 abandoning your honesty

212
00:11:07.166 --> 00:11:10.125
and integrity,

213
00:11:10.125 --> 00:11:13.375
then it seems sweet only for some time,

214
00:11:13.375 --> 00:11:17.458
and ultimately when success disappears,

215
00:11:17.458 --> 00:11:21.083
it leaves a bitterness in the mind.

216
00:11:21.083 --> 00:11:24.208
But if you work

217
00:11:24.208 --> 00:11:27.625
with integrity and honesty,

218
00:11:27.625 --> 00:11:29.833
then you obtain permanent success

219
00:11:29.833 --> 00:11:32.583
and honor in life.

220
00:11:32.583 --> 00:11:35.875
Think, what will you want?

221
00:11:35.875 --> 00:11:38.333
Such a professional life

222
00:11:38.333 --> 00:11:41.000
where people respect not you,

223
00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:43.708
but only your position,

224
00:11:43.708 --> 00:11:46.291
your success.

225
00:11:46.291 --> 00:11:50.125
And when your defeat happens,
they start celebrating,

226
00:11:50.125 --> 00:11:53.916
start scorning you. Or

227
00:11:53.916 --> 00:11:56.708
will you want such a professional life

228
00:11:56.708 --> 00:12:00.291
where people respect you
 not as a position or fame,

229
00:12:00.291 --> 00:12:01.708
but as

230
00:12:01.708 --> 00:12:05.250
a good person?

231
00:12:05.250 --> 00:12:08.750
You also know the right answer.

232
00:12:08.750 --> 00:12:10.916
Positions will keep coming and going,

233
00:12:10.916 --> 00:12:13.083
wealth will keep coming and going,

234
00:12:13.083 --> 00:12:16.583
but permanent respect will be obtained only

235
00:12:16.583 --> 00:12:20.125
when you do your work honestly

236
00:12:20.125 --> 00:12:23.166
and respect others.

237
00:12:23.166 --> 00:12:26.791
So when the right answer is known,
 the direction is known,

238
00:12:26.791 --> 00:12:29.541
then why be attracted to cleverness, deceit,

239
00:12:29.541 --> 00:12:34.500
greed, etc.?

240
00:12:34.500 --> 00:12:36.666
Walk on the path of truth,

241
00:12:36.666 --> 00:12:40.333
walk on the path of spirituality,

242
00:12:40.333 --> 00:12:42.541
walk on My path.
